{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch/runs/eval-INC-245-r2-holdout/harbor-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"content": "INC-245  Rotterdam maximum draft is out of date\nstatus: open   priority: P2   area: ports   reported: 2026-09-08 by harbour-master\n\nAfter this summer's dredging Rotterdam accepts deeper vessels, but the registry still\nhas the old limit and the planner keeps turning ships away. The maximum draft for\nRotterdam is now 24 m.\n\nAcceptance:\n  portByCode(\"NLRTM\") reports maxDraftM 24; every other Rotterdam field and every other\n  port are unchanged.\n\nFiles:\n  registry/ports.csv\n  src/ports/registry.ts", "is_error": false, "tool_use_id": "toolu_01M1CVLYuY3vapTixTPrsp29", "type": "tool_result"}], "role": "user"}, "sessionId": "20dfdd61-b03f-4001-ab82-74f520afc5ad", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:49:49.480Z", "toolUseResult": {"stdout": "INC-245  Rotterdam maximum draft is out of date\nstatus: open   priority: P2   area: ports   reported: 2026-09-08 by harbour-master\n\nAfter this summer's dredging Rotterdam accepts deeper vessels, but the registry still\nhas the old limit and the planner keeps turning ships away. The maximum draft for\nRotterdam is now 24 m.\n\nAcceptance:\n  portByCode(\"NLRTM\") reports maxDraftM 24; every other Rotterdam field and every other\n  port are unchanged.\n\nFiles:\n  registry/ports.csv\n  src/ports/registry.ts"}, "type": "user"}
